  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AOAV&#x2019;s Explosive Violence Monitor Project (EVMP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Armed conflicts and the use of explosive weapons in populated areas result in significant civilian casualties and long-term humanitarian consequences. However, there is a continuing gap in systematic data collection on the impact of explosive violence. Governments, international organisations, and humanitarian actors require accurate and timely data to advocate for stronger legal protections, influence policy, and provide targeted humanitarian responses.Through this activity, AOAV aims to ensure greater accountability, stronger policy measures, and improved humanitarian responses to the devastation caused by explosive weapons</narrative>
  </description>
